SUMMARY:Petaluma Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:The 19th Annual Petaluma Music Festival will feature:\n* 14 fantastic bands on 3 stages\, including 10\,000 Maniacs\, The Smithereens\, Chuck Prophet\, Cherry Poppin’ Daddies\, Alejandro Escovedo\, Spike Sikes & His Awesome Hotcakes\, and many more!\n* A shaded seating section for VIP ticket holders and sponsors with complimentary hors d’oeuvres\, wine\, and beer\n* The fine beers of the Lagunitas Brewing Company and Old Caz Beer\n* Free drinking water\n* A variety of specialty food\, merchandise\, and local business vendors\n* State-of-the-art sound system and staging\n* Music artist booth for audience meet-and-greet\, autographs\, and artist merchandise\n* Festival merchandise including t-shirts and posters\n* All proceeds benefit the music education programs of all Petaluma area public schools
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/petaluma-music-festival/
LOCATION:Petaluma Fairgrounds\, 175 Fairgrounds Dr.\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival
END:VEVENT
