SUMMARY:Community Market Summer Music Series: Brian Francis Baudoin & The Swampdawgs
DESCRIPTION:Brian Francis Baudoin & The Swampdawgs bring blues\, roots music\, swamp rock\, and Americana to Community Market’s Summer Music Series. \nThey’ll be joined by special guests Imperial & Prairie for a summer evening of soulful\, rootsy music on the Mel Minton Memorial Stage. Bring a chair\, grab something good from Community Market\, and settle in for a great night of live music outside. \nFree and all ages.
