SUMMARY:8th Annual Wine Country Comedy Fest! - DAY 3
DESCRIPTION:The Laugh Cellar presents:\n8th Annual Wine Country Comedy Fest\nWine Country’s funniest weekend is just around the corner! \nFeaturing writers from hit television shows\, Comedy Central standouts\,\ncomedy award-winners\, and more\, this year’s fest is set to be unforgettable. \nJuly 23 Buena Vista Winery\nJuly 24 Balletto Vineyards\nJuly 25 DeLoach Vineyards \nBig laughs. Beautiful Venues. Three days of world-class comedy\, unforgettable nights and wine country vibes!\nOne day – $44\nTwo-day pass – $80\nThree-day pass – $122
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/8th-annual-wine-country-comedy-fest-day-3/
LOCATION:Deloach Vineyards\, 1791 Olivet Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy
END:VEVENT
