SUMMARY:Sunday Sessions at Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Take in the beautiful westerly views of the rolling hills and vineyards at Paradise Ridge Winery. Enjoy our Sunday Live Music Sessions the 1st & 3rd Sundays of each month. Listen to popular tunes and acoustic music all while taking in the warm summer weather and vineyard ambience. We offer a variety of artisan cheeses\, cured meats\, olives\, hand pies and other light fare. A wonderful way to spend a Sunday afternoon in Paradise!
